<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African Sept business confidence index 115.9.</title>
<headline>S.African Sept business confidence index 115.9.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Chamber of Business said its business confidence index (1990 = 100) fell by 1.1 percentage points to 115.9 points in September from 117.0 points the previous month and was up from 115.6 a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
